    "versionDate": "2026-10-06",
    "versionDescription": "Mangayomi 0.9.8 | Mangayomi-v0.9.8-ios\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(tracker): improve Trakt.tv multi-season mapping, watchlist, and ratings sync by @lee-gangjin in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1024\n* feat(tracker): Add backlog sections (Plan to read/Watchlist), handle AniList 429 rate limits, and prioritize Trakt series by @lee-gangjin in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1030\n* fix(mihon): use the Cloudflare proxy for extension-server sources by @matsukiender-star in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1026\n* fix(mihon): identify which source of an extension a call is for by @matsukiender-star in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1027\n* Improve LNReader extension compatibility\n* fix: stale chapter page lists and add WebP decoding on Linux by @MenaHere in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1031\n* fix: remember window geometry on Linux; add missing libavif to AppImage to resolve closure by @MenaHere in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1032\n\n## New Contributors\n* @lee-gangjin made their first contribution in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1024\n* @matsukiender-star made their first contribution in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1026\n* @MenaHere made their first contribution in https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/pull/1031\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kodjodevf/mangayomi/compare/v0.9.7...v0.9.8",
